  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=769685), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=5168599)\n\nCome on. I want to sleep!\"\n\nJae-young's daily life, which maintained a perfect work-life balance, was shattered by serious insomnia.  \nOne day when I was sleeping overtime, Sun-woo's voice, which I heard overheard, led Jae-young to a sweet honey sleep...  \nJae-young, who tells Sun-woo, who met him again at work, to put him to sleep!  \nBut Sunwoo is the CEO of the company who ran away from the inauguration ceremony?!\n\nSunwoo's romantic comedy, which requires Sunwoo's voice for a good sleep life, and Sunwoo's voice complex to defend his representative position.",
